<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><meta charSet="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/><link rel="preload" as="image" href="/images/ThePoolLab.png"/><link rel="preload" as="image" href="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71avyX9pZUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg"/><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_next/static/css/d071dca61fbb01bf.css" crossorigin="" data-precedence="next"/><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_next/static/css/0fc6c400c3ed5371.css" crossorigin="" data-precedence="next"/><link rel="preload" as="script" fetchPriority="low" href="/_next/static/chunks/webpack-9104c05f1a1687bc.js" crossorigin=""/><script src="/_next/static/chunks/fd9d1056-4dbbcf07a05c3f48.js" async="" crossorigin=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/472-6eced84fcf03e6a3.js" async="" crossorigin=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/main-app-ce281d8555633725.js" async="" crossorigin=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/326-bff252670b7455ef.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/413-e7f375c310822fe5.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/app/reviews/%5Bsku%5D/page-158ca34b840e43ec.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/975-95592eb349967368.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/app/layout-4ee2f436a51b65f2.js" async=""></script><title>Aiper Seagull Pro Review - The Pool Lab</title><meta name="description" content="The world&#x27;s first cordless robotic cleaner that can clean the floor, walls, and waterline."/><link rel="canonical" href="https://www.the-pool-lab.com/reviews/Aiper-Seagull-Pro"/><meta property="og:title" content="Aiper Seagull Pro Review"/><meta property="og:description" content="The world&#x27;s first cordless robotic cleaner that can clean the floor, walls, and waterline."/><meta property="og:image" content="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71avyX9pZUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg"/><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"/><meta name="twitter:title" content="The Pool Lab - Your ultimate guide to Robot Pool Cleaners, reviews, and maintenance tips."/><meta name="twitter:description" content="Your ultimate guide to Robot Pool Cleaners, reviews, and maintenance tips."/><meta name="twitter:image" content="https://www.the-pool-lab.com/images/ThePoolLabOG.png"/><script src="/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-c67a75d1b6f99dc8.js" crossorigin="" noModule=""></script></head><body class="d-flex flex-column min-vh-100"><nav class="navbar navbar-expand-lg navbar-light bg-light"><div class="container"><a class="navbar-brand d-flex align-items-center" href="/"><div style="width:160px;height:90px;position:relative;margin-right:10px"><img src="/images/ThePoolLab.png" alt="The Pool Lab Logo" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain"/></div><span class="d-none d-sm-inline">The Pool Lab</span></a><button class="navbar-toggler" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#navbarNav"><span class="navbar-toggler-icon"></span></button><div class="collapse navbar-collapse" id="navbarNav"><ul class="navbar-nav ms-auto"><li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/">Home</a></li><li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/reviews">Reviews</a></li><li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/best-of">Best of</a></li><li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/guides">Guides</a></li><li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/about">About</a></li></ul></div></div></nav><main class="flex-grow-1"><div class="container my-5"><div class="row"><div class="col-lg-8"><h1 class="mb-3">Aiper Seagull Pro<!-- -->: In-Depth Review</h1><div class="text-center mb-4 p-3 bg-white rounded border" style="height:400px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center"><img src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71avyX9pZUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg" alt="Aiper Seagull Pro" class="img-fluid" style="max-height:100%;max-width:100%;object-fit:contain;width:auto;height:auto"/></div><p class="lead">The Aiper Seagull Pro is the big brother to the Scuba series, boasting a quad-motor system that delivers serious power in a cordless package. It claims to be the world&#x27;s first cordless robot that can effectively clean the floor, walls, and waterline, challenging the dominance of corded units.</p><h3 class="mt-5">Who This Is For</h3><div><p>This is the ultimate cordless choice for:</p><ul><li>Owners who want <strong>cordless freedom AND waterline cleaning</strong>.</li><li>Larger pools (up to 3200 sq. ft.).</li><li>Those who want a powerful vacuum without the wire.</li><li>Early adopters of new technology.</li></ul></div><h3 class="mt-5">Who Should Skip It</h3><div><p>Pass if:</p><ul><li><strong>You want proven longevity:</strong> Cordless tech is newer and batteries degrade.</li><li><strong>You hate heavy lifting:</strong> It's heavier than the Scuba S1.</li></ul></div><h3 class="mt-5">Key Features</h3><div><ul><li><strong>Quad-Motor System:</strong> Powerful suction and drive.</li><li><strong>Wall & Waterline Cleaning:</strong> Full pool coverage cordless.</li><li><strong>3-Hour Runtime:</strong> Long-lasting battery for large pools.</li><li><strong>Rapid Charge:</strong> Full recharge in ~90 minutes.</li><li><strong>Dial Control:</strong> Select Floor, Wall, or Auto mode via a dial.</li></ul></div><h3 class="mt-5">Detailed Analysis</h3><div><p><strong>Quad-Motor System:</strong> The Seagull Pro uses a dual-suction and dual-drain motor system. This allows it to process a massive amount of water (130 GPM), giving it suction power comparable to corded units. It can pick up leaves and debris that smaller cordless units leave behind.</p><p><strong>Wall & Waterline Cleaning:</strong> Unlike many battery robots that just do floors, the Seagull Pro climbs all the way to the top. It has a dedicated mode for wall cleaning, allowing you to focus its battery life where you need it most.</p><p><strong>Fast Charging:</strong> It features a rapid charging system that gets the battery full in about 90 minutes, which is impressive for a unit with a 3-hour runtime. This minimizes downtime between cleans.</p></div><div class="row mt-4"><div class="col-md-6"><div class="card border-success h-100"><div class="card-header bg-success text-white">Pros</div><ul class="list-group list-group-flush"><li class="list-group-item">Most powerful cordless robot available</li><li class="list-group-item">True waterline cleaning capability</li><li class="list-group-item">Long battery life and fast charging</li><li class="list-group-item">Large debris inlet</li><li class="list-group-item">No cables to tangle</li></ul></div></div><div class="col-md-6"><div class="card border-danger h-100"><div class="card-header bg-danger text-white">Cons</div><ul class="list-group list-group-flush"><li class="list-group-item">Heavy to lift out of the pool</li><li class="list-group-item">Charging port plug can be finicky</li><li class="list-group-item">Pricey for a cordless unit</li><li class="list-group-item">Retrieval requires patience</li></ul></div></div></div><h3 class="mt-5">Final Verdict</h3><p>The Aiper Seagull Pro proves that cordless robots are ready for the big leagues. It offers power and coverage that rivals corded units, with the ultimate convenience of being wire-free. While it requires the daily ritual of charging, the trade-off is a pool deck completely free of trip hazards. It&#x27;s the best cordless cleaner on the market today.</p></div><div class="col-lg-4"><div class="card sticky-top" style="top:20px"><div class="card-body text-center"><h5 class="card-title">Aiper Seagull Pro</h5><p class="card-text">Ready to buy? Get the best price online.</p><a href="https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0GGHMHD5W?tag=scorpiusllc-20" target="_blank" class="btn btn-warning btn-lg fw-bold w-100 ">Check Price on Amazon</a><small class="text-muted d-block mt-2">We may earn a commission on qualifying purchases.</small></div><div class="card mt-4"><div class="card-header bg-light fw-bold">Consider These Alternatives</div><ul class="list-group list-group-flush"><li class="list-group-item d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center"><a class="text-decoration-none fw-bold" href="/reviews/Aiper-Scuba-S1">Aiper Scuba S1</a><span class="badge bg-secondary rounded-pill">$<!-- -->579</span></li><li class="list-group-item d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center"><a class="text-decoration-none fw-bold" href="/reviews/Dolphin-Premier">Dolphin Premier</a><span class="badge bg-secondary rounded-pill">$<!-- -->1599</span></li></ul></div></div></div></div></div></main><footer class="bg-dark text-white text-center py-3 mt-auto"><div class="container"><p class="mb-1">© <!-- -->2026<!-- --> <!-- -->The Pool Lab<!-- -->. All rights reserved.</p><small class="text-white-50">The Pool Lab<!-- --> is a participant in the Amazon Services LLC Associates Program, an affiliate advertising program designed to provide a means for sites to earn advertising fees by advertising and linking to Amazon.com.</small></div></footer><script src="/_next/static/chunks/webpack-9104c05f1a1687bc.js" crossorigin="" async=""></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0]);self.__next_f.push([2,null])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"1:HL[\"/_next/static/css/d071dca61fbb01bf.css\",\"style\",{\"crossOrigin\":\"\"}]\n2:HL[\"/_next/static/css/0fc6c400c3ed5371.css\",\"style\",{\"crossOrigin\":\"\"}]\n0:\"$L3\"\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"4:I[3728,[],\"\"]\n6:I[9928,[],\"\"]\n7:I[8326,[\"326\",\"static/chunks/326-bff252670b7455ef.js\",\"413\",\"static/chunks/413-e7f375c310822fe5.js\",\"183\",\"static/chunks/app/reviews/%5Bsku%5D/page-158ca34b840e43ec.js\"],\"\"]\n8:I[6954,[],\"\"]\n9:I[7264,[],\"\"]\nb:I[7625,[\"326\",\"static/chunks/326-bff252670b7455ef.js\",\"975\",\"static/chunks/975-95592eb349967368.js\",\"185\",\"static/chunks/app/layout-4ee2f436a51b65f2.js\"],\"\"]\nc:I[6507,[\"326\",\"static/chunks/326-bff252670b7455ef.js\",\"975\",\"static/chunks/975-95592eb349967368.js\",\"185\",